                            <comment id="497101" author="gerrit" created="Tue, 30 Jun 2026 23:01:57 +0000">&lt;p&gt;"Jinshan Xiong &amp;lt;jinshanx@google.com&amp;gt;" uploaded a new patch: &lt;a href="https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/67001" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/67001&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
Subject: &lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20442" title="Implement per-object IO stats for obdfilter" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-20442"&gt;&lt;del&gt;LU-20442&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; ofd: implement per-object/FID-level I/O statistics&lt;br/&gt;
